    {
      "Original": "As of version xxxx, QST includes a feature where you can click the ! button next to the quest progress buttons to report an issue with the current quest. This message is to notify you that if you choose to make use of this new feature and submit a bug report, QST will automatically capture and upload the following information:",
      "Translated": "从 xxxx 版本开始，QST 包含一个功能，您可以点击任务进度按钮旁边的！按钮来报告当前任务的问题。这条消息是为了通知您，如果您选择使用这个新功能并提交 bug 报告，QST 将自动捕获并上传以下信息：",
